      },
      "message": "feat(tools): tool library import modes - add, update in place, replace\n\nImportTools takes an ImportMode (Add default, unchanged). Update puts a\nsame-named tool's imported definition in place (entity and controller\nnumber kept, operations go Stale); Replace also removes document tools the\nlibrary lacks, refused by name when an operation uses one. One undo unit.\nGUI mode combo, cam.importTools / MCP import_tool_library mode parameter.\n\nFixes #899\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
